# ---- pi-msp: in-process MSP kernel (vendored ModelShellProxy) ----
# Swift build products from `bash packages/msp-kernel/build.sh`. The vendored
# Swift *source* under packages/msp-kernel/swift/Implementations is tracked;
# only the compiled .build tree is ignored (221MB of object files, module
# caches, and index stores).
packages/msp-kernel/swift/.build/
# Compiled kernel shared library, wherever build.sh dropped it (also copied next
# to the deliverable by install scripts; that copy lives under dist/ which is
# ignored below).
*.so
*.dylib
# SwiftPM package state (not currently generated, keep out defensively)
packages/msp-kernel/swift/.swiftpm/
packages/msp-kernel/swift/Package.resolved

# ---- pi-msp: bundled CPython runtime (from bundle-python.sh) ----
# The self-contained python/ tree next to the deliverable is a build artifact;
# regenerate with `bash packages/msp-kernel/bundle-python.sh <dest>`.
packages/msp-kernel/python/


